*------------------------------------------------ 100 ptw_min_alttop_nofence_ctl
*  CONTROL FOR CLASS (a), AND A THIRD CLASS IN ITS OWN RIGHT -- NO FENCE ANYWHERE.  body_root IS
*  published (no RESUME-NIL line) and the blob is STILL red: an ALT top whose arm is itself a concat
*  ending in an alternation publishes the arm's first node as the resume carrier, so an external
*  beta re-enters an exhausted inner alternation and concedes instead of walking out to the ALT.
*  Not the fence rung; own row.  The barer twin ( 'a' | 'aa' ) is green, which is what makes this
*  a carrier-SELECTION defect and not a missing-carrier one.
          P = ( 'a' ('b' | epsilon) | 'aa' )
          'aa' POS(0) *P RPOS(0)                :S(OK)F(NO)
OK        OUTPUT = 'match'                      :(END)
NO        OUTPUT = 'nomatch'
END
*------------------------------------------------------ 101 ptw_min_arb_cond_ctl
*  CONTROL (GREEN): the same ARB with a CONDITIONAL assignment (.) retries correctly.
          E = ARB . v
          'a+aa' POS(0) *E RPOS(0)              :S(OK)F(NO)
OK        OUTPUT = 'match' v                    :(END)
NO        OUTPUT = 'nomatch'
END
*---------------------------------------------- 102 ptw_min_arb_immed_inline_ctl
*  CONTROL (GREEN): the witness's pattern written INLINE always worked -- so the ingredient is NOT "$ on a retrying generator".
*  Pair with ptw_min_arb_immed_stored.sno, which is the SAME pattern reached through a stored pattern value.
          'a+aa' POS(0) ARB $ v RPOS(0)         :S(OK)F(NO)
OK        OUTPUT = 'match' v                    :(END)
NO        OUTPUT = 'nomatch'
END
*--------------------------------------------------- 103 ptw_min_arb_immed_retry
*  FALSE REJECT: ARB with an IMMEDIATE assignment ($) cannot retry to reach RPOS(0). Oracle matches; SCRIP says nomatch.
          E = ARB $ v
          'a+aa' POS(0) *E RPOS(0)              :S(OK)F(NO)
OK        OUTPUT = 'match' v                    :(END)
NO        OUTPUT = 'nomatch'
END
*-------------------------------------------------- 104 ptw_min_arb_immed_stored
*  WITNESS (was RED): a STORED pattern carrying $ refuses to retry.  NO deferred evaluation is involved --
*  E is referenced BARE, so `*E` was never the ingredient; building the pattern by assignment is.
          E = ARB $ v
          'a+aa' POS(0) E RPOS(0)               :S(OK)F(NO)
OK        OUTPUT = 'match' v                    :(END)
NO        OUTPUT = 'nomatch'
END
