END
*----------------------------------------------------- 140 ptw_min_compose_nocap
*  s182 -- ptw_min_compose SIMPLIFIED: the capture is NOT an ingredient (measured).
*  A runtime-composed pattern value (P2 = A B, both variable-held) loses ARBNO's
*  RETRY when a later element fails.  Oracle backtracks into ARBNO and extends; SCRIP does not.
*  REQUIRED: the whole-program fz poison ($(...)= / EVAL / CODE / CONVERT / CLEAR).
          $('ZZ') = 1
          A = ARBNO('a')
          B = ''
          P2 = A B
          'aa' POS(0) *P2 RPOS(0)               :S(OK)F(NO)
OK        OUTPUT = 'match'                      :(END)
NO        OUTPUT = 'nomatch'
END
